INFRA NOTES
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- REAL TestLink cloned at build time (Dockerfile ARG TL_REF: v0=tag 1.9.19, v1=commit e2bebf684,
  v2=tag 1.9.20). No TestLink tree committed to the case dir.
- MariaDB 10.6; db-init.sql creates one DB PER VERSION (testlink_v0/v1/v2). REQUIRED: a 1.9.19 app
  rejects a 1.9.20-seeded DB ("Database version upgrade required") and blocks login -- each app must
  seed its OWN version-matched schema (entrypoint.sh seeds DB_NAME from the cloned install SQL).
- php-pcb.ini sets display_errors=Off. REQUIRED: TestLink calls error_reporting(E_ALL); the legacy
  1.9.19 code emits warnings from config.inc.php BEFORE session_start(); with display_errors=On that
  text corrupts the HTTP headers ("headers already sent") so PHPSESSID is never set and login can
  never persist. Off (production default) routes them to the log; it does NOT touch TestLink code.
- checkConfiguration() only requires config_db.inc.php to exist (else it bounces to /install); the
  entrypoint writes it, so the REAL index.php serves without running the install wizard.
- mcr.microsoft.com/playwright/* unreachable in this infra -> Docker-Hub selenium/standalone-chromium
  (Selenium Grid on :4444) + a python selenium runner (victim.py). callback.py is a ThreadingHTTPServer.
- Ports: v0=34520 v1=34521 v2=34522 victim=34570 callback=34590 (chromium + db internal-only).

STATUS: gate_passed (real Docker, real-app-http, external HTTP trigger). Case enters the benchmark.
